Package: supergfxctl
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Graphics mode switching for hybrid-GPU laptops
 supergfxd, a system daemon, and supergfxctl, its command-line client,
 switch a laptop with an integrated and a dedicated GPU between modes:
 Hybrid (both GPUs), Integrated (the dedicated GPU powered off) and
 Vfio (the dedicated GPU handed to virtual machines). Made for ASUS ROG
 laptops, it works with other hybrid laptops too.
 .
 The service is installed but not enabled: the Oaxaca desktop's
 Hardware > Hybrid GPU writes /etc/supergfxd.conf first, then enables it.
